sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Checkout
    actor Customer
    box Shop
        participant Web as Web front
        participant API as Order API
    end
    participant Bank as Payment gateway

    Customer->>Web: Place order
    activate Web
    Web->>+API: POST /orders
    API->>API: validate basket
    API-->>-Web: 201 Created
    deactivate Web
    Note over Web,API: the order exists, nothing is paid yet

    loop every 5s until settled
        Web->>+Bank: authorise
        alt card accepted
            Bank-->>-Web: approved
            Web-)API: mark paid
        else card declined
            Bank--xWeb: declined
        end
    end

    opt receipt wanted
        API->>Customer: e-mail receipt
    end

    Note right of Customer: done
